{"t":"Golden Fir Cone","s":"golden-fir-cone-0806d","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Golden_Fir_Cone_694d43.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Golden Fir Cone</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Golden Fir Cone\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Fir_Cone_694d43.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tools and other Equipment<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30,000 - 80,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110628233959&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Fir_Cone_694d43.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a golden fir cone.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used to <a href=\"#/wiki/Kingly%20Deer\">tame</a> an <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kingly%20Deer\"><img alt=\"Kingly Deer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kingly_Deer_f5a252.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a>. It has a 25%-33% chance to break when used. You may need 2-4+ to successfully tame an <a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a>.<br/>\nAlthough normal <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer\">White Deer</a> can't handle a human's weight, <a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a> have extra strength that allows them to do so.\n</p><p><b>Failed</b>:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The white deer flees.</span>\n</p><p><b>Failed</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The white deer sniffs and wheezes, trying to withstand the taming.</span>\n</p><p><b>Broke</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Oh no... the enraged deer angrily ripped the fir cone from your hands!</span>\n</p><p><b>Succeeded</b>: <br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You tamed the white deer.</span>\n</p><p><b>Trying to tame a White Deer</b>:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You should try to enrage this deer before your taming attempt. That way you make sure it's strong enough to carry you.</span>\n</p><p><b>Trying to tame a Desperate White Deer</b>:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">This deer doesn't show enough strength and is too desperate already. Only enraged deer have the necessary power to carry you.</span>\n</p><p><br/>\nTake a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a> to Sweaty Cyclops and say: <i>hi</i>, <i>melt</i>, <i>yes</i>, <i>yes</i> (you do not need to have completed <a href=\"#/quest/the-sweaty-cyclops-quest\">The Sweaty Cyclops Quest</a>). You will get a Cup of Molten Gold. Using it on a Fir Tree or a Fir Cone will give you a small chance (around 10%) to make a Golden Fir Cone.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Contest Prizes</li><li>Cup of Molten Gold</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li>Fir Cone</li><li>Fir Tree</li><li>Friend of Elves</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kingly%20Deer\">Kingly Deer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/overhunting-world-change\">Overhunting World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer\">White Deer</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["overhunting-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"overhunting-world-change","quest":"Overhunting World Change","step":"1-3","n":5,"title":"Domar um White Deer","kind":"needed","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Bane Lord","pct":2.128,"qty":"1","hp":"3,000","exp":"500","loc":"Green Claw Swamp , on the Bewitched area.","places":[{"name":"Green Claw Swamp","x":32759,"y":31989,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp"},{"name":"Bewitched","x":32699,"y":32009,"z":7,"href":"#/quest/bewitched"}],"href":"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord"}]}}